From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bmpriest <benjamin.m.priest@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 03:09:45 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] frontend: MinUI/NextUI launcher integration


Wire a MinUI/NextUI module (minui.{h,cpp}) into the SDL frontend so the
launcher's own artifacts line up with what DSperate writes:

  - the power button, read from evdev (a short press sleeps, a held press
    quits through the ordinary exit path so the battery save is written);
  - the slot thumbnail and marker the game switcher reads, written on every
    user save and load;
  - a game_switcher hotkey action, unbound by default;
  - emu.state_key = code|rom, so states can be keyed on the ROM filename as
    the launcher keys everything else;
  - minarch-style screenshot names.

During a network session the game switcher hotkey writes no state: nothing
could resume the conversation it froze. Rebased from
minui-nintendo-dsperate-pak's 0003 onto upstream main.
